  "description": "Offering a tough metal construction and IP65 ‘weatherproof’ rating, the Encore LB15IP is a linear LED wash fixture designed for rental, event production and concert production applications. It features 15 x 20-Watt quad color RGBL (Red, Green, Blue and Lime) LEDs which offer a huge variety of color options, including white light with a variable color temperature of 2700K to 7000K, and a high CRI. Each of the LEDs can be controlled independently and has a tight beam angle of 11-degrees with the option to change the beam to 25-degrees with the supplied frost filter.",
